% Every ancestor pair in programs/kinship.dl: positive examples for
% lesson 25.  No negative examples are given, so the world is closed:
% every other pair of people is one.
%
%   python3 foil.py programs/kinship.dl --examples programs/ancestor.examples

ancestor(ada, ben).  ancestor(ada, cat).  ancestor(ada, dov).
ancestor(ada, eve).  ancestor(ada, fay).  ancestor(ada, gus).
ancestor(ada, hal).  ancestor(ada, ivy).  ancestor(ben, dov).
ancestor(ben, eve).  ancestor(ben, gus).  ancestor(cat, fay).
ancestor(cat, hal).  ancestor(cat, ivy).  ancestor(dov, gus).
ancestor(fay, hal).  ancestor(fay, ivy).
